/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:1:你是一个 ARC-AGI 谜题设计专家。下面的 20 道参考题是难度和机制质量的标杆。仔细阅读每道题的**解题逻辑**（解题者从样例归纳规则的认知过程），而非表面场景。你的新题应在机制深度和隐蔽性上与参考题持平或者实现超越。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:2:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:3:每个参考题描述包含：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:4:- `description`：一句话概述题目的变换目标。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:5:- `Input structure`：输入网格中有哪些对象、背景、标记、边界或组件。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:6:- `Rule`：从输入到输出的确定性变换规则。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:7:- `Key insight`：解题所需的核心洞见。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:8:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:9:参考题目如下：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:10:<reference_puzzle index="1" source="eval" puzzle_id="d8e07eb2" lines="29-47">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:11:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:12:Look up query glyphs in a reference table and mark whether they form a line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:13:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:14:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:15:- Teal background with two full-width pink separator rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:16:- Above the first separator is a query row of 5x5 glyph cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:17:- Between separators is a reference table of the same 5x5 cells; a glyph is
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:18:  identified by both its color and its 3x3 shape.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:20:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:21:- Green-fill the background inside every table cell whose glyph exactly
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:22:  appears in the query row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:23:- If the matched table cells form one complete row or one complete column,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:24:  also green-fill the query band and the bottom verdict band.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:25:- Otherwise leave the query band unchanged and fill the bottom verdict band red.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:26:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:27:Key insight: The bottom color is not a count; it is the yes/no answer to
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:28:whether the queried glyphs align as a full row or column in the table.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:29:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:30:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:31:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:32:<reference_puzzle index="2" source="eval" puzzle_id="20270e3b" lines="7-21">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:33:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:34:Connect two sprites using matching connector pixels, then tight-crop.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:35:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:36:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:37:- Background color `bg`, sprite color `obj`, connector color `ctrl` (small, 2 components).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:38:- Two main foreground sprites, plus possibly tiny detached pixels belonging to one sprite.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:39:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:40:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:41:- Identify the **base** sprite (closest to grid top-left).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:42:- Translate the other sprite so its connector sits one cell above the base's connector.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:43:- Stamp the plug onto the base; remove connectors (recolor `ctrl` to `obj`).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:44:- Output is the tight crop around all non-background pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:45:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:46:Key insight: The connector pixels define the unique docking point and direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:47:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:48:</reference_puzzle>
