/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:50:<reference_puzzle index="3" source="eval" puzzle_id="9aaea919" lines="38-51">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:51:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:52:Transfer sprites from red-marked lanes to green-marked lanes, recoloring and stacking.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:53:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:54:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:55:- bg = most common color. Red (2) and green (3) thin bars define vertical lanes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:56:- Each lane contains repeated identical monochrome sprites in an evenly spaced vertical grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:57:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:58:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:59:- Each red lane's sprites turn grey (5); their count transfers to the nearest green lane.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:60:- New sprites fill empty lattice slots bottom-up, using the source shape recolored to the destination lane's sprite color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:61:- All marker bars are removed.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:62:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:63:Key insight: Sprite count is conserved across lanes — red sprites become grey, and equally many new sprites stack into the green lane's regular grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:64:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:65:</reference_puzzle>
