/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:68:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:69:Complete outlined shapes and carry attached shadow pixels along their edges.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:70:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:71:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:72:- bg = background. Each active color marks vertices of an 8-direction aligned outline.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:73:- A start vertex can have adjacent non-bg, different-colored shadow pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:74:- Other colored pixels may be distractors unless they lie on valid drawable edges.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:75:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:76:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:77:- For each color, order its pixels by polar angle around their centroid to form a cycle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:78:- Draw only horizontal, vertical, or 45-degree edges whose interiors are clear.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:79:- From the chosen start vertex, copy adjacent shadow offsets along each drawable edge
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:80:  when the parallel path is in bounds and clear.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:81:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:82:Key insight: The main outline is reconstructed first, then the start vertex's neighbor offsets define parallel shadow strokes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:83:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:84:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:85:
