/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:87:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:88:Dock movable tools into border-anchored frames by filling cavities.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:89:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:90:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:91:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:92:- Border-touching components cluster into anchor frames with interior bg cavities.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:93:- Non-border 2-color components are movable tools.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:95:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:96:- Match each tool to a frame whose cavity size equals one of its color-region counts.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:97:- Rotate/flip the tool so one color fills the cavity exactly; the other stays outside.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:98:- If the docking orientation uses a reflection, swap the tool's two colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:100:Key insight: Cavity size determines tool–frame pairing; reflection triggers color swap.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:101:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:102:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:103:
