/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:105:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:106:Recolor a cropped template and repeat it according to a component-count stencil.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:107:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:108:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:109:- Solid blue (1) separator rows or columns split the grid into four sections.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:110:- Section 1 is a black-background shape template; section 2 is a component-count stencil.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:111:- Sections 3 and 4 are solid color swatches for output foreground and background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:112:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:113:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:114:- Crop section 1 to the bbox of its non-black pixels and recolor it with the two swatches.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:115:- Count 4-connected non-black components in section 2.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:116:- Repeat the recolored crop that many times, inserting one background-colored row/column between copies.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:117:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:118:Key insight: The second section encodes only the repeat count; the output orientation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:119:is inherited from whether the input separators are columns or rows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:120:</description>
