/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:124:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:125:Propagate a repeating striped pattern from a yellow border segment toward the opposite edge, recoloring foreground objects on certain stripes.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:126:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:127:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:128:- bg = most common color. Foreground blobs of another color scattered in the interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:129:- A short yellow (4) segment sits on one border edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:131:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:132:- From the yellow segment, march toward the opposite edge in steps of 2 cells, cycling colors Y, Y, G (4, 4, 3). The 1-cell gap between stripes is forced to bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:133:- Yellow stripes paint only within the segment's span.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:134:- Green stripes additionally recolor all non-bg pixels across the entire row/column to green.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:135:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:136:Key insight: Green stripes act as a "flood" that recolors existing objects on the full row/column, while yellow stripes are confined to the segment span.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:137:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:138:</reference_puzzle>
