/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:141:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:142:Simulate tokens falling through a pipe network after gates rotate open.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:143:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:144:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:145:- Wall (0), bg (pipe fill), gate (horizontal 1×3 bars), token (small edge pixels).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:146:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:147:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:148:- Rotate each gate into a vertical blocker; gate cells become bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:149:- Tokens drop downward through bg, choosing the extreme column for their side (left→min, right→max).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:150:- Tokens settle at true pipe ends (adjacent to wall/boundary), packing inward.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:151:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:152:Key insight: Tokens select drop columns by entry side and land at wall-bounded endpoints, ignoring blocker-bounded ones.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:153:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:154:</reference_puzzle>
