/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:158:Remove diagonal staircase noise and complete broken straight lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:159:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:160:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:161:- bg = background; one foreground color fg forming axis-aligned lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:162:- Some fg pixels form 45° diagonal chains (8-connected but 4-disconnected from lines).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:163:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:164:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:165:- Delete all diagonal-only fg pixels (those with no orthogonal fg neighbor, only diagonal ones).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:166:- Fill short gaps in horizontal/vertical lines where a deleted diagonal was nearby.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:167:- Prune remaining diagonal-adjacent leaf pixels near former diagonal sites.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:168:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:169:Key insight: Diagonal pixels are hints marking where a straight line is broken; their span sets the maximum gap size to fill.
