/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:190:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:191:Emit four teal beams from a square, turning at colored obstacles per a legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:192:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:193:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:194:- Top band: grey (5) legend with colored vertical bars in cells; bar position (left or right) encodes turn direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:195:- Below: main grid with bg, a solid teal (8) square, and colored obstacle blocks.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:196:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:197:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:198:- Remove the legend from the output.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:199:- From the teal square, shoot a beam in each cardinal direction (as a sliding copy of the square).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:200:- Each beam paints teal over bg cells as it moves.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:201:- On hitting an obstacle of color C, consult the legend: bar on left → turn counterclockwise, bar on right → turn clockwise. Continue in the new direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:202:- Beams stop at grid edges.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:203:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:204:Key insight: The legend's bar position (left vs right within its cell) is the encoding for turn direction at each obstacle color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:205:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:206:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:207:
