/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:246:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:247:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:248:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:249:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:250:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:251:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:252:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:253:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:254:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:255:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:256:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:257:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:258:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:259:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:260:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:261:
