/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:282:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:283:Complete a grid of colored blocks to match a minimap legend in the top-left corner.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:284:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:285:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:286:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:287:- Top-left corner: a small sprite of single colored pixels forming a minimap pattern on a regular lattice.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:288:- Main area: uniformly colored square blocks (NxN) arranged on a regular grid; some positions are empty (bg).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:289:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:290:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:291:- The legend pixels define a color pattern; each pixel's lattice position maps to a block position in the main grid via a fixed scale factor and offset.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:292:- Existing colored blocks confirm the scale/offset alignment.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:293:- For every legend pixel whose corresponding grid position is empty, place a new block of that color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:294:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:295:Key insight: The top-left pixel pattern is a scaled-down minimap of the block layout; the mapping is inferred from blocks already present.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:296:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:297:</reference_puzzle>
