/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:333:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:334:Replicate a pre-drawn corner pattern to every other marker-bearing corner.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:335:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:336:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:337:- bg = most frequent color. Hollow 0-frames (possibly partial L-shapes); each
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:338:  frame-corner cell is either 0 or a painted (non-bg, non-0) color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:339:- >= 1 'source' corner: the pattern is already drawn (one color, both outward
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:340:  cells and an inward-diagonal trail).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:341:- Other corners: a single colored pixel on the inward diagonal at the pattern's
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:342:  deepest (k,k) offset; the pixel's color is that corner's target color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:343:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:344:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:345:- Extract the canonical (TL-oriented) pattern from any source.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:346:- For each non-source corner whose marker cell is colored, paint the same
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:347:  pattern rotated to that corner's orientation, using the marker's color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:348:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:349:Key insight: the pattern is symmetric about the corner's inward-diagonal axis
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:350:(canonical dr == dc), so it reflects cleanly across all four corner orientations.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:351:Painting uses each target's OWN marker color, not the source color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:352:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:353:</reference_puzzle>
