/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:355:<reference_puzzle index="20" source="eval" puzzle_id="78332cb0" lines="10-23">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:356:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:357:Reorder 5×5 blocks into a connected strip by matching edge foreground pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:358:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:359:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:360:- bg = background; sep = divider color (full row/column lines).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:361:- Several 5×5 sprite blocks in a grid, separated by sep lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:362:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:363:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:364:- Two blocks "connect" when their facing edges share foreground pixels at the same offset (e.g., A's right edge ∩ B's left edge).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:365:- Chain all blocks in the orientation (horizontal or vertical) that admits a complete sequence.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:366:- Output is a 1×N strip of blocks in chain order, separated by sep lines.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:367:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:368:Key insight: Edge-contact overlap determines both block ordering and output orientation.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:369:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:370:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:371:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed309175298/1/prompt.md:372:你的任务：
